
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-event">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`collision_end(Detected: {DetectedEvent})`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`collision_end(integer NumberOfCollisions)`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Triggered when task stops colliding with another task</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Detected / </span><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>NumberOfCollisions / num_detected</span></td>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Table with the detected events / </span><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span></span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-detected">Detected Event</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Phantom objects can never receive trigger collision events.</li>
    <li>`<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlVolumeDetect" target="_blank">llVolumeDetect</a>(<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a>)` objects get trigger <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Collision_start" target="_blank">collision_start</a> and collision_end but not <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Collision" target="_blank">collision</a>() events.</li>
    <li>A collision with a hovering avatar does not trigger collisions, unless the avatar turns or moves.</li>
    <li>Only a physical object will get collision events from colliding with a non-physical object.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`collision_end(integer total_number)
{
    llOwnerSay("The collision I've had with " + llDetectedName(0) + "has ended.");
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
